# Important rule for editing or updating files in this repo
Keep all personally identifiable information ("PII") OUT of the repo. That includes: 
* Names
* file paths

They must never be committed to the repo. Use skill workspace-python-and-powershell-files for instructions on how to include PII in .gitignored *.yaml or *.mdata files. 